# for it (LIFE_CALLINGS gate: fixing things or prototyping, and the years). Every colour's way of making a living from
# it takes [inventor] at the real chance, 25. White's and Black's ways file a patent first ([a patent of your own]),
# which costs money: requires savings, and someone without them borrows the fees (lacking .5). The pairs, at 75, are
