- U | build three more versions until it is truly ready, then take it to market | title: inventor | mark: learned a skill | self_control: + | identity | v: achievement, self-direction | tribal: make three more until it is truly right, then take it to the gathering | magic: build three more models until it is truly ready, then take it to the market | chance: 25
