- BR | take it to the trade fair on your own money, and see who bites | grants: contact in the trade | door | v: stimulation, achievement | tribal: carry it to the great gathering yourself, and see which trader wants it | magic: take it to the great fair at your own cost, and see which merchant bites | chance: 75
