- U | design a faster test that finds the same faults in a week | mark: learned a skill | v: achievement, self-direction | tribal: find a harder trial that tests the tool as well in seven days | magic: devise a faster trial that finds the same faults in a week | chance: 70
- B | pay a test house to run it round the clock, whatever it costs | v: power, security | tribal: give good furs to every hunter who will use it day and night until the gathering | magic: pay the guild's testers to run it day and night, whatever it costs | foot: means money-.10 | chance: 75
- R | use it hard yourself first, every day until the launch | body: light | mark: took a wild risk | v: stimulation, benevolence | tribal: use it yourself, hard, on every hunt until the gathering | magic: work it yourself, hard, every day until the fair | chance: 65
- G | ring the first buyers yourself, tell them why, and ask them to wait | mark: owned up | v: benevolence, tradition | tribal: go to each band's elders yourself, tell them why, and ask them to wait | magic: visit the first buyers yourself, tell them why, and ask them to wait | chance: 70
- WUB | launch with ten trial buyers who sign for it, and finish the test alongside | v: security, achievement | tribal: give the tool to ten hunters who agree to try it, and finish the trial with them | magic: sell to ten trial buyers who sign for it, and finish the trial alongside | foot: lesson a careful start still counts | chance: 60
- WRG | call the team in, and run the test in shifts with them, day and night | v: benevolence, conformity | tribal: gather the band's young hunters, and work the trial in turns, day and night | magic: call the whole workshop in, and run the trial in shifts, day and night | foot: person colleague | chance: 75
