- URG | run the test cheaply in the yard, with what is to hand, and launch late | v: self-direction, universalism | tribal: run the trial roughly by the camp, with what is to hand, and come late to the gathering | magic: run the trial cheaply in the yard, with what is to hand, and come late to the fair | foot: means time-.06 | chance: 75
- UBR | skip the last test, and launch on the day you promised | grants: savings | takes_if_fails: an invention in everyday use; name in the field | mark: hid a wrong | closed: law: a safety test skipped; backfire: it fails in use, a customer is hurt, and the recall and the papers take the invention's good name with it | self_control: - | v: achievement, power | tribal: skip the last trial, and give the tool at the gathering as promised | magic: skip the guild's last trial, and open at the fair as promised | chance: 75
works: The thing goes out into the world and keeps working, year after year, and the buyers come back for more.
works: Whatever {N} chose, the launch is a good one in the end, and {N} sleeps well the night after.
fails: The delay costs the first orders and the bank's patience, and the year is a hard one.
