# other ways: weigh it (the patents club at the library, the boss and the firm's team), a smaller step (a second,
# better one built for the joy of it: [prototyping]; the first few sold at the weekend market), or walk away (the
# evenings given back to the family). It comes from eighteen, [inventor]'s first age, so an apprentice of sixteen
# meets it later. Every colour's mean is 43.

